o17@gmail.com&gt; - 7.1.2-1" date="1758715200">- Update to 7.1.2.\n- Enable VANC processing for SDI.\n- Explicitly list all implicitly enabled/disabled options.</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Neal Gompa &lt;ngompa@fedoraproject.org&gt; - 7.1.2-2" date="1763380800">- Disable lc3 only on RHEL 10</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Dominik Mierzejewski &lt;dominik@greysector.net&gt; - 7.1.4-1" date="1778155200">- Update to 7.1.4.</changelog>\n</package>\n')
